@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title State Machine Diagram - Visit Lifecycle v1.2

[*] --> BelumCheckIn : visit is scheduled for a confirmed booking
BelumCheckIn --> CheckedIn : admin records patient arrival
BelumCheckIn --> TidakHadir : no-show rule is met
CheckedIn --> MenungguAntrean : check-in data and queue number saved
MenungguAntrean --> Berlangsung : visit encounter is opened
Berlangsung --> Selesai : visit is closed after required workflow is completed

TidakHadir --> [*]
Selesai --> [*]

note right of BelumCheckIn
  Visit is associated with a confirmed Booking.
  Visit status tracks attendance and encounter progress only.
  It does not replace Booking status or individual service status.
end note

note bottom
  State names and exact transition conditions are proposed for analysis
  and require stakeholder validation before technical sign-off.
  Individual service progress is tracked in Service Execution lifecycle.
  Invoice and Payment lifecycles remain separate.
end note
@enduml
